  "details": "When building for Android, it requests the user to switch to ASTC in order to upload to Android.\n\nUnfortunately, this is now bypassed by the latest SDK Beta.\n\n**VRChat Engineers:** In order to fix this issue, you MUST change the Player settings for Android under Project Settings in the Avatars SDK **Template** (in VCC) to be configured for ASTC on Android right off the bat when the SDK is installed/updated!",
